# S-044: count > 1 repeats a frame; timestamps advance by frame_time per pass; every pass counts in total_frames.
vopen v I420 30 1 16 8 3
vconnect v a 1
vlock v 3 1000000 0x77
vunlock v
vstate v
vdump v
vlock v 2 0 0x78
vunlock v
vstate v
# count 0: the frame is "complete" only after the first pass makes count -1 -> never; but a count of 0 is outside
# the preconditions, so it is not tested here.
vclose v
